  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment grant to support the water and sanitation project in Bosnia and Herzegovina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the implementation of the currently on-going WATSAN projects significant investments gaps were identified, thus further negotiations to extend loan financing for additional projects are already taking place. This Action would provide additional financial support to finalize implementation of on-going and ready-made project activities within WATSAN projects in selected municipalities in BiH by contributing to the grant component of the financial mechanism.</narrative>
  </description>
